IS 6932 : Part 1 : 2025 Building Limes - Method of Test - Part 1 Determination of Insoluble Residue in Dilute Acid and Alkali, Loss on Ignition, Insoluble Residue in Hydrochloric Acid, Silicon Dioxide, Ferric and Aluminium Oxide, Calcium Oxide and Magnesium Oxide
